00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:04.789 align:start position:0%
 
this  is a press conference being given or a  press statement  being made by the leader of hamas  in the light of the attacks on gaza and  the  subsequent ceasefire which went into  effect in the early hours  of february let's listen to what he has  to say  this greatness  bravery  first and foremost  in jerusalem west bank 1948  territories they all marched towards  al-aqsa mosque to protect and safeguard  the holy site  with their bare hands to prove to the  whole world  that al-aqsa is ours jerusalem is ours  and the palestinian people the whole  nation cannot give up on it  al-aqsa mosque  the road to our prophet's accession to  heaven  the resistance lived up to the  aspiration of the palestinian people  praise and glory to god almighty as  he continues to bestow on us  new hopes opening  new horizons for a new cycle  the epic center is the palestinian cause  the focus is jerusalem  why not it is the first of  the two qiblas for the muslim nation  and it is the road through which our  prophet  took in his assistion to heaven  to our palestinian people and to  all free men worldwide  i bring to you this good news  good news of victory  strategic complex  and compound  by the palestinian people supported by  all three honest men  this victory was bestowed on us  by the grace of god  the merciful the almighty no victory  but that bestowed by god almighty  the all-knowing the old wise if  you are granted victory you  cannot be defeated it is true  it is a divine victory  why not why not  as gaza the defiant gaza  together with the defiant gazans  have rose  to the holy sites and to our people in  the 1948  territories who are living  in the thick of the fray  we rose to defend them  and to be in their support it is  a victory carved  by the noble blood of the fallen martyrs  and  holding steadfast in the face of the  belligerent  hostilities perpetrated by  the israeli occupation forces chiefly  among  them as they didn't  joined hands  heavy blow to the enemy this blow  will leave an indelible mark  on the israeli occupation forces on  their political  security and military institutions  we salute our resistance  and their leadership  assisted by his brothers in the  leadership  of the movement and our  other fellow palestinians the leaders of  the brigade  whose name was chanted by  millions in jerusalem  in the holy site following  the prayers gathered  thousands gathered to pray to god  almighty  to bless the resistance  and the leadership of this fearless  brave honest man muhammad  his name echoed in the holy site a  thousand chanted his name  despite the fact that they have  never met him or even  seen  along with his fearless brave men of the  resistance  and other leaders of the resistance  factions  unless the holy sites and the entire  soil of the palestinian  territories are liberated  yes today we are standing today  with our heads held high before  those fearless  brave leaders some of them has fallen as  martyrs  like jamal zebda and other fellow  martyrs  then the list  our brave resistance fighters who are  standing steadfast  i begin saying that jerusalem  is the center of the struggle  the first  this is a message to our enemy the  israeli occupation forces  and to the whole world that  jerusalem is the center of our struggle  and we cannot relent  until  history  our spirit our faith our  future the first of  the two qiblas of the muslim nation  it is the heart of our civilization  the one in the past and the one to come  the second issue i wanted to address is  gaza it was gaza and the gazans  who stood as a guarding shield  defending jerusalem glorious gaza  and the gazans for the fourth time  standing in defiance without  as our prophet once said to his  companions  who is to carry this sword  for me  one of the companions stepped forward  and the prophet handed over the sword to  him  yes it was gaza and the gazans  who carried the sword  they stood as a guarding shield  defending  the holy site they have dealt  a heavy blow to the enemy  despite the geographical distance  between  this lesson it is the beginning  gazans the resistance are the guardian  shield  of jerusalem and the whole palestinian  territories  we have dealt a heavy blow to the enemy  weed their calculations  and a third issue i wanted to address  is that the blessed resistance  is ever more robust than ever  more powerful and before  all we have our unshaken  belief our firm conviction  we have employed all our creativity  in defense and in the offense  we will going to grow  and we will continue to grow more robust  simply because we are defending a noble  cause  a national one it is  the cause to liberate our occupied  territories  and free our prisoners  what happened is nothing but a strategic  victory simply because what's  to come is no doubt different  from what was before it ushered  into new  era more victories will come  more successes will come  more strategies will be built  that's why we consider that  this battle was a paradigm shift  gigantic leap in our struggle  against the zionist enemy  epic victory has disturbed  the calculation of the enemy and that's  why  our people our resistance  and our fellow supporters  are now prepared for a new era  it is the post jerusalem sword  operation it is a divine victory  it is a strategic victory that's why  i called it it is a compound victory  at the internal level at the region 11  and at the ban islamic level it is  a strategic victory as the whole  palestinian territories  all the palestinian people across all  our territories  have come together in west bank  and in gaza  more than 28 palestinians  have fallen as martyrs in their march  towards al-aqsa mosque  our palestinian communities in jordan  and lebanon we have all come  together it is a palestinian  islamic and regional victory  once and once again i praise  god almighty for this blessed victory  what's next  with the preliminary calculations  following  this battle and after all the facts  established  and new realities on the ground to all  our people on all three honest men  worldwide  that we are required to work  on different paths  first our resistance  is the shortest way towards  has destroyed the deal of the century  the falsehood mongered by the enemies  it has destroyed  all the force aspirations penned our  normalizations  with the israeli occupation forces  that's why once again it is only  resistance  that is the shortest course towards  liberation  second it is our unity the unity of the  palestinian people within  and without within and beyond  all the palestinian people have come  together one  united body around  their resistance  we will continue to embark on these  huge efforts in order to achieve  a true genuine unity  at the level of all the national  institutions  and here this spirit  of resistance should be instilled across  our territories  simply because this battle has ushered  us  into a new era of unity  a third important issue is two  main fences with our arab and regional  neighborhood  we have all witnessed how all the people  in the region  with their various and different  political  affiliations they have all come  together supporting palestine and  resistance  and here i call on all our arab  muslim and regional countries to come  together  and take part in building a  comprehensive strategy  on how to move forward  and how to restore our equilibrium  we should  reinforce our relations with the  international community  we have all witnessed the huge  change in the narrative and rhetoric  all across the globe even  inside the united states we have seen we  have seen massive protests  in many capital cities worldwide calling  for an end  to the zionist occupation and  restoration of the palestinian people's  rights  we are required to cement  our relations with the international  community and world  world states finally  who paid the heaviest  sacrificing every deer for the sake  of jerusalem  it w